    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A clear, self‑attested photocopy of the vehicle’s Registration Certificate (RC) is mandatory. It confirms the vehicle’s identity and ownership, enabling the transport operator to verify the vehicle’s details at every checkpoint.</p>
