    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate must be valid at the time of departure. Transport authorities in both Delhi and Srinagar check this certificate to ensure compliance with environmental regulations.</p>
